    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing shooting game. Here, you will become a Japanese sharpshooter and embark on a challenging adventure. Each level is well designed, waiting for you to complete various tasks and unlock new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img]  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main scene, you can freely choose the level you want to enter. After completing each level, you will unlock the next level. After completing all the levels, you will unlock the free mode and enjoy endless shooting fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are distributed on various maps, and your task is to complete the goal by defeating them. Every time an enemy is killed, they will have a certain refresh time, and you need to be vigilant at all times. It is worth noting that when the enemy is damaged, they will summon other enemies around, which increases the challenge of the game. Attacking different parts of the enemy will produce different effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the map, you can find some items to enhance your damage and health. Just get close to these items to use them. In addition, the bow and arrow will increase the damage after charging, making you more threatening in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal mode, after completing a mission, you will see a door leading to the next area. Entering this door will complete the current level and start a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the challenge? Come and show your shooting skills and become a real marksman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to operate:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the menu button on the left handle to open the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the trigger button on the right handle and release to fire the arrow. Without releasing the trigger, you can charge the bow by moving or swinging the right handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the touch pad on the right handle to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the touch pad on the left handle to rotate the direction.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing shooting game. Here, you will become a Japanese sharpshooter and embark on a challenging adventure. Each level is well designed, waiting for you to complete various tasks and unlock new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img]  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main scene, you can freely choose the level you want to enter. After completing each level, you will unlock the next level. After completing all the levels, you will unlock the free mode and enjoy endless shooting fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are distributed on various maps, and your task is to complete the goal by defeating them. Every time an enemy is killed, they will have a certain refresh time, and you need to be vigilant at all times. It is worth noting that when the enemy is damaged, they will summon other enemies around, which increases the challenge of the game. Attacking different parts of the enemy will produce different effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the map, you can find some items to enhance your damage and health. Just get close to these items to use them. In addition, the bow and arrow will increase the damage after charging, making you more threatening in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal mode, after completing a mission, you will see a door leading to the next area. Entering this door will complete the current level and start a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the challenge? Come and show your shooting skills and become a real marksman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to operate:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the menu button on the left handle to open the menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the trigger button on the right handle and release to fire the arrow. Without releasing the trigger, you can charge the bow by moving or swinging the right handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the touch pad on the right handle to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the touch pad on the left handle to rotate the direction.</p>",
